        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-15T18:03:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "let\u0027s open a bug?\n\nI think we can just decide with comment explanation that we just got back to SNK/SRC READY and report that this shouldn\u0027t happen with console print maybe (or also print in discard, since it shouldnt\u0027 happen that much?)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 938,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 938,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "2f32dd48ad71741414904abf295ba7645006b393",
